{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2024-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1704067200, "end_date": 1704671999, "month_true_total": 202, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:22:57 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "155512496", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050798398", "personaname": "Dank Man Dan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DankManDanny/", "num_games_owned": 828, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 4186, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4186, "last_played": 1704647785, "avatar": "41a546b91e2aa608855a032c60bb04ecc6c608b9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is pretty fun on the hardest difficulty but if you play anything else it's a brain drain. Would personally only buy if you have friends to play with, playing with AI sucks and the randoms you get paired with seem to have some severe neurological impairment.\n\nGoing for 100% achievements made me and my friends wanna kill ourselves, overall decent game.\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2995174053", "timestamp_created": 1704664979, "timestamp_updated": 1704665053, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.582994520664215088", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155505786", "author": {"steamid": "76561199167951065", "personaname": "moonub", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199167951065/", "num_games_owned": 144, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 9877, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8941, "deck_playtime_at_review": 114, "last_played": 1772433065, "avatar": "15b243fb8c78ed3661012ae61e5ab8477533fbb6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a fun, accessible co-op shooter in the aliens universe. A lot of the action feels like \"stand your ground\" type scenes, with hoards of aliens rushing your squad. It's good if you came here to \"get your gun off\", and feels tactile. The game isn't huge but there's high quality level design and enough variety that I kept coming back with different friends and sunk 200+ hours on it (between Steam and Game Pass). The higher difficulty levels can be a bit frustrating in that enemies become bullet sponges, which seems off for the game world - it would make more sense if there were more bad guys, and they did more damage, but little aliens shouldn't be taking multiple clips to kill. But steer clear of that and you can still have what feels like an authentic, enjoyable aliens experience. It's a good looking game, too. It would amazing if the dev's ever get time to revisit and add DLSS support and path-tracing/ raytracing to move atmosphere up a level but this is already a very glossy aliens looking game, and I highly recommend it.", "timestamp_created": 1704658773, "timestamp_updated": 1704658773, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155494480", "author": {"steamid": "76561198137256373", "personaname": "ZER0", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zerotopz/", "num_games_owned": 123, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 6024, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2870, "last_played": 1733944134, "avatar": "7936a5a3024bedc0916ae194c9eb1488e01d9afc"}, "language": "english", "review": "The best Multiplayer game!", "timestamp_created": 1704649505, "timestamp_updated": 1704649505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighte